  m_Name: Nona
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Nona
  LastName: Beridze
  Nickname: 
  Occupation: Census Recorder
  CharacterDescription: Still, unblinking, smiles at the wrong moments, speaks of the State with a radiant, unsettling joy
  CharacterArc: Late 30s, probably. It is difficult to be certain. Nona has worked as a census recorder for eleven years, quietly cataloguing who lives where, who has moved, who has died. To her it is not a job but a sacrament. The State is her faith, and she believes completely that it cannot err, that it sees everyone, and that it will come to save every citizen who obeys. Since the blast, she has never been happier. She does not ask what the blast was. She only knows the State is finally acting, and every curfew, every checkpoint, every empty apartment is proof that the plan is unfolding exactly as it should. She hums while she fills the gaps in the registry. Every doubt is a heresy she is delighted to report. She holds eye contact for slightly too long and beams when people question the curfew, as if she is already writing their names down. Nothing she says is technically wrong. Nothing she does is technically alarming. But everyone who passes through leaves with a faint, unexplainable discomfort they cannot put into words.
  DateOfBirth: 07/07/1951
